---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---
<Layout title="About - StudyHelp" description="About StudyHelp - subject-wise FAQs for TSPSC and TS exam preparation.">

  <Header active="about" />

  <div class="content">
    <h1>About StudyHelp</h1>
    <p style="font-size:17px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px;">
      StudyHelp is built for TSPSC and TS exam aspirants who want clear, chapter-wise FAQs to prepare with, without wading through long articles or scattered notes.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:17px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px;">
      We are starting with Telangana History, with Telangana Economy and English versions of both subjects coming soon. Every subject is organized chapter by chapter, so you can focus on exactly the topic you are revising.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:17px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px;">
      Reading starts free, no login needed. Once you have explored enough to know the content is useful, subjects can be unlocked for unlimited access with a one-time payment, no subscription.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; color:var(--muted);">
      Questions or feedback? Reach out through the contact details on our subject pages, or check the Plans page for pricing details.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
